	(text "Bright: LDR ~10k, SENSE high -> Q1 on -> GATE low -> LEDs off.\nDark: LDR ~1M, SENSE < 0.6 V -> Q1 off -> R3/R4 charge C3 -> Q2 on -> D1-D3 light.\nRV1 sets the switching light level; R4/C3 (~1 s) give a soft fade instead of flicker.\nD4 is a power indicator."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
